wireless-regdb: unlocked db from github.com/grinderz/wireless-regdb

PKG_MIRROR_HASH is the sha256 of dl/wireless-regdb-<version>.tar.zst as
packed by include/download.mk from the git checkout (identical in 24.10
and 25.12). 25.12 verifies it after a git fetch, 24.10 does not: a stale
value breaks only here. Take the "got" hash from the first failed build
when the commit moves.

Index: package/firmware/wireless-regdb/patches/500-world-regd-5GHz.patch
